  "prefLabel": "Env-A 608.04 Review Criteria",
  "priorExpiration": "2011-10-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 608.04 Review Criteria. The department shall review each application for a state permit to operate to ensure compliance with:\n\n(a) All applicable elements of the SIP;\n\n(b) Env-A 100 et seq.; and\n\n(c) Applicable state law governing air pollution.\n\nSource. #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; ss by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
